# 2026-07-29: hostname canonicalisation. www.thaiear.com and thaiear.pages.dev were each
# serving a full 200 copy of every page. Both already emit a canonical pointing at the apex,
# but a canonical is a hint, not a directive — Search Console had indexed www separately
# (12 of the homepage's 42 impressions landed on www), splitting the ranking signal.
# 301 is a directive, so both hosts now consolidate onto the apex.
# Preview deploys (<hash>.thaiear.pages.dev) do NOT match this and are unaffected.
https://www.thaiear.com/*    https://thaiear.com/:splat  301
https://thaiear.pages.dev/*  https://thaiear.com/:splat  301
